/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  Benchmark A (developer-facing; benchmarks/README.md): the reference
  simulator's "Cavett's Problem" sample -- Cavett's four-flash recycle train
  AS THAT SAMPLE SHIPS IT: its reading of the stage pressures as psig, its
  feed (15 components, no undecane), its three compressors and three valves
  closing the recycles -- reproduced as a Choupo case on PR78 with the PPR78
  group-contribution kij evaluated at each separator's declared temperature.
  The problem is theirs; every property number is Choupo's own or a cited
  primary (constant/parameters/PPR78/jaubert2010.dat).  See README and
  `reference`.  The corpus case on the PRIMARY specification,
  tutorials/steady/flowsheets/cavett01_recycle_train (SRK, kij = 0, psia),
  is untouched and is NOT this case.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

application   choupoSolve;
description   "Benchmark A: Cavett's recycle train as the reference sample ships it -- psig pressures, compressors and valves, PR78 + PPR78 kij at each separator's T";

verbosity     2;
